{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"12999","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:12999","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"岸本みゆき","creatorId":"egs:creator:32224","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:32224","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:32224","name":"岸本みゆき","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:195957","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"櫂人(柴乃櫂人)","creatorId":"vndb:s8634","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3491","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8634","name":"櫂人(柴乃櫂人)","roleCode":"character-design","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:80288","source":"egs"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_176625","characterName":"ユウ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"176625","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ユウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"12"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"146"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グリモア・マギ。属性は『闇』。ラピスの位置は左手の甲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院に遣わされた特別魔法探偵士。冷静にして、自信家、大人たちもかなわない推理ぶりを披露する飛び級のマギの騎士。覚醒は10歳の時で、「ズバリ」が口癖。ラピスで文献に触れることによって、内容を直接読み取ることが可能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘いものが好物。特に「チョコチップチョップクッキー」が大好物。嫌なことがあると、手にした手帳に記載しているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キリカ学長の玄孫（ひ孫の子）に当るらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"176625"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec8833f63f8eb4f9bf16855778e6957ca5b2843fb8133ca20158db9bff2a7a2b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61343bb15df76321116bf4f15a7ea05356327447a8234e5fcfe1b15906ac18a7.webp","width":152,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"喜多村英梨","creatorId":"vndb:s269","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s269","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s269","name":"喜多村 英梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:176625:4251:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_176626","characterName":"ライラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"176626","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ライラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"15"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲と隔絶され、独自の魔法体系が育っている幽谷の仙術師。属性は『水』。ラピスの位置は右手の平。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仙道を極め、怪しげな仙術を扱い、自らを「師匠」と呼ぶ。人々の風聞にあがる、実態不明の幽谷の民。語尾に「~っす」と付けるのが口癖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飄々と流し、流され生きている。珍しいモノが大好き。唱える呪文はもっともらしいものもあるが、ほとんどが適当なもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仙道の秘術故か1000年以上の時を生きているらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"176626"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/688cc303c3fcffd59aa676fdecda7fe8b939e66c94d218634aaaa51537bafadd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb369ed1f443964f59684be204760b4aeca991d783eeec6e2796df80be167116.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"こやまきみこ","creatorId":"vndb:s1596","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1596","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1596","name":"こやま きみこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:176626:4326:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46424","characterName":"レフィ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46424","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"レフィ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ベルセルク・マギ。属性は『無』。ラピスの位置は両肩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウルガルド魔法騎士学院に転入してきた少年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖精の「瞳狩り」に襲われたことで、マギの騎士として目覚める。通常一つであるラピスを二つ有する、伝説にも語られる「双紋のラピス」の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い意志を持つゆえ、我を張りすぎる一面も。よくお腹をすかせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"後に星の瞳として目覚めラグナロク・マギとなる。それにより変身シーンも変化、属性も『銀』に変わり、ラピスも一つになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46424"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98010b62a67429ba841f36f451a7741d7a26e4e57edd53b49415c4a3cb5c04b4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09cd6220933f3ae74c56b0a4eedffa1e5a7605bedbb7be58291035f820d4ee51.webp","width":146,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s103","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s103","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s103","name":"小野 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46424:4456:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46425","characterName":"エルル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46425","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"エルル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セイレーン・マギ。属性は『水』。ラピスの位置は背中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"医療魔法をきわめるために勉強中、医食同源のもと、料理の研究にも余念がない。みんなを癒すことを目標に頑張っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理は美味しいと評判だが、ときおり塩と砂糖を間違えるおっちょこちょいな一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セイレーン・マギの性質により天使の声を聞くことができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天使が黄昏になったことにより自身も仮死状態となるが、輪廻の河にてラグナロク・マギとなったレフィの心の叫びによって生還する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46425"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/81d96850cded31e8ad0fca56dd2168f29e7b90942ecaba97fa19dc0ee273a10a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba5332e130649dcdfb1270f904171645cee74e67a258b13a9d534537df5d42f9.webp","width":146,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村繪里子","creatorId":"vndb:s1648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1648","name":"中村 繪里子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46425:4991:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46426","characterName":"アシュレイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46426","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"アシュレイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァルキュリア・マギ。属性は『闇』。ラピスの位置は胸部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒バラの騎士と呼ばれる、美しく気高きマギの騎士。フルネームはアシュレイ・アナン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貴族の名門アナン家を継ぐものであり、メイガスのサブリーダー。憧れている女生徒も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"風紀委員長として規則違反を取り締まり、その鉄拳制裁は怖れられている。実は可愛いもの好きで、コピンに並々ならぬ興味を示す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フェリシアとの戦いで命を落とした兄を思い出す為、ディーノを苦手としている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46426"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ac8e9e960fedeb9087f5e26455cc55da71bcf1010915322427a1755861ac2e7e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/12802873c4ec74ff3e24e661184d3bd5166fbb1c9062759f216951eeb4c789eb.webp","width":208,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水樹奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s1236","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1236","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1236","name":"水樹奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46426:1:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46427","characterName":"グレン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46427","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"グレン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"183"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ケルベロス・マギ。属性は『火』。ラピスの位置は腹部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウルガルド魔法騎士学院のNo.1であり、マギの騎士の集団メイガスのリーダーである。人一倍責任感が強く、仲間思い。また伝説の戦士アーノギアと同じとされる「紫雲のラピス」の持ち主ともされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々の鍛錬を怠らず、力を強さを追い求めている。生徒たちの人望も厚く、慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァレリのテネス・ラピスによってネフィリアになりかけるがレフィの力によって自分を取り戻す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また選択肢によって生死が分かれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46427"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e14caaa98e83089926a1e5e11fb90abb00ef39a00687fae2a2226b262742908.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a98e7771cafb3014362aab9182922c46df032cb89f861e27815c080a6027892.webp","width":75,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉田智和","creatorId":"vndb:s370","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s370","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s370","name":"杉田 智和","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46427:4513:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46428","characterName":"ハイネ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46428","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ハイネ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"イージス・マギ。属性は『木』。ラピスの位置は腹部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウルガルド魔法騎士学院のマギの騎士の先輩。秀でた防御力を有している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘はあまり好きではないが、その能力ゆえにマギの騎士に。でも最大の武器は憎めない笑顔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さまざまな可愛いものが大好きで、「可愛いモノには、全て可愛い匂いがある」という持論の持ち主。「カワイイ探知機」なる感覚を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元はモニーク家という貴族の出だが、没落し貧乏生活の為タフに育った模様。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46428"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/1040dc14b2031768269eb9463ec03b479f497243b5d74362f81d11f1b6e726c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb4106b267189f073cd7b97d02db5d7d3d57725746b9b383821662e59f36e9bf.webp","width":115,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"吉野裕行","creatorId":"vndb:s241","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s241","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s241","name":"吉野 裕行","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46428:3955:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46431","characterName":"イナルナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46431","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"イナルナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"156"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"イシュタル・マギ。属性は『光』。ラピスの位置は額。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖パルディア王国のお姫様。イナルナと呼ばれているが、フルネームはイナールナディア・イスタシア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おてんばでわがままと噂されている。何事にも積極的だが、王室育ちゆえにどこか世間とずれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46431"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f57492a1d6b64c28630a912cd2932b1f2af5b0304331da71f0fdbd967b99ac74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcdbf78acfeb1b5622674e90bebe4545c887da5d45b81bd9ddc79776d578e0ee.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"沢城みゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s43","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s43","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s43","name":"沢城 みゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46431:4244:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46432","characterName":"ヴァレリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46432","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァレリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"38"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"167"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"フェリシアとの戦いの司令官。ウルガルド魔法騎士学院にてマギの騎士たちを指揮する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳しい現実と責任を背負いながら冷静な判断力と素早い行動力で戦いを勝利へと導く。心静かに、包むように生徒を見守る存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は月の刻を司るネフィリアを統べる者・テロスである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千年前から生きており元々は夜魔界の天使の巫女。しかし人間に疎まれる様になりテロスとなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな境遇の自分を救ってくれたアーノギアに恋をするが、レフィたちに敗れた後未練だけの魂の存在となり自分に振り向きはしなかったアーノギアを討つ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46432"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f3a24624c318928bae9be2cdec56fd5f8a912a140a478e4fae8a2587e6eeee0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e092c1223e338df64ceb478cde9b55ebd5a9428b5952e7c829c3f6117a092a43.webp","width":113,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中原麻衣","creatorId":"vndb:s444","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s444","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s444","name":"中原 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46432:4145:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46434","characterName":"ディーノ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46434","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ディーノ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"23"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"181"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"フェンリル・マギ。属性は『風』。ラピスの位置は胸部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖精の瞳狩りにあったマギの騎士。行方を明かされず、生死の縁より帰還した謎多き存在である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸にあるラピスは「キメララピス」と呼ばれる人工のラピスで、魔力の制御や増幅などを行うことができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アナン家に仕える身であり、アシュレイを身を挺して守る、忠節と孤高の騎士。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46434"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4e48725dd1373baf4fb835b9e93ec8eeac47beedf991f8de0192386a048ade5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95728ffa79921ccfc756732d82e95a828d063d80139eff921fa3e176002605ad.webp","width":99,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村悠一","creatorId":"vndb:s348","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s348","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s348","name":"中村 悠一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3240:46434:4724:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_46435","characterName":"シオン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46435","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"3240"}]},"originalCharacterName":"シオン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"166"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴィーナス・マギ。属性は『風』。ラピスの位置は左足の皿の部分。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教室のお掃除をはじめ、細やかな気配りで、学院のみんなから信頼され好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その包容力は何にも勝る大きな力。厳しい戦いを繰り返すマギの騎士たちを勇気づけ励ます。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹のサラとともに学院で暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"将来の夢は舞台女優。この姉妹は実は、100年前の世界より時空を飛び越えてレフィたちの現代へ流れ着いた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46435"}],"profileFa